Cell["\<\
The Dynkin indices are normalized to 1/2 for fundamental representations, \
which fixes all other representations. \
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1043313733,ExpressionUUID->"f08f67d6-c30a-49e1-b7ee-1a9e6017c0c0"],

